sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Host
    participant L as Launcher
    participant R as Runtime
    participant C as Cells

    Host->>L: spawn (inherits host env)
    Note over L: gates: secrets → entry<br/>node → version<br/>fail ⇒ exit 78 / 127<br/>logged, host shows failed<br/>at once, no 60 s hang
    L->>R: exec node dist/index.js, env only
    Note over R: reads the cell catalog<br/>11 cells, entry + digest<br/>node floor per cell
    R->>R: register 305 tool names<br/>(591 declared; namespacing off)
    Host->>R: initialize + tools/list
    R-->>Host: 305 tools, ~260 ms
    R->>C: spawn cell on first tool call
    Note over C: on demand, so boot<br/>does not pay for<br/>10 processes
